{"title":"Piano Man","artist":"Billy Joel","sourceId":"reference:Fz1ueVryXQ7ojffCDMus","sourceHash":"8bc483167a429472c48b2fbf7a32d1bcd855dbb04807c0652267fe55b855a235","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36841161,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":35.08,"end":40.15,"text":"It's nine o'clock on a Saturday","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":40.15,"end":43.4,"text":"The regular crowd shuffles in","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":43.4,"end":47.83,"text":"There's an old man sittin' next to me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":47.83,"end":51.98,"text":"Makin' love to his tonic and gin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":61.64,"end":66.26,"text":"He says, \"Son can you play me a memory?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":66.26,"end":69.89,"text":"I'm not really sure how it goes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":69.89,"end":74.38,"text":"But it's sad and it's sweet and I knew it complete","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":74.38,"end":78.6,"text":"When I wore a younger man's clothes\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":78.6,"end":83.59,"text":"La, la-la, di-di-da","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":83.59,"end":90.56,"text":"La-la di-di-da da-dum","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":90.56,"end":94.84,"text":"Sing us a song, you're the piano man","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":94.84,"end":98.49000000000001,"text":"Sing us a song tonight","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":98.49000000000001,"end":102.78999999999999,"text":"Well, we're all in the mood for a melody","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":102.78999999999999,"end":107.03999999999999,"text":"And you've got us feelin' alright","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":120.73,"end":125.2,"text":"Now John at the bar is a friend of mine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":125.2,"end":129.06,"text":"He gets me my drinks for free","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":129.06,"end":133.29,"text":"And he's quick with a joke, or to light up your smoke","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":133.29,"end":139.17000000000002,"text":"But there's some place that he'd rather be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":139.17000000000002,"end":143.29,"text":"He says, \"Bill, I believe this is killing me\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":143.29,"end":147.15,"text":"As a smile ran away from his face","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":147.15,"end":151.7,"text":"\"Well, I'm sure that I could be a movie star","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":151.7,"end":155.61,"text":"If I could get out of this place\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":155.61,"end":160.49,"text":"Oh, la, la-la, di-di-da","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":160.49,"end":167.81,"text":"La-la di-di-da da-dum","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":167.81,"end":171.62,"text":"Now Paul is a real estate novelist","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":171.62,"end":175.4,"text":"Who never had time for a wife","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":175.4,"end":179.93,"text":"And he's talkin' with Davy, who's still in the navy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":179.93,"end":185.03,"text":"And probably will be for life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":193.85,"end":198.0,"text":"And the waitress is practicing politics","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":198.0,"end":201.72,"text":"As the businessmen slowly get stoned","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":201.72,"end":205.92000000000002,"text":"Yes, they're sharing a drink they call loneliness","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":205.92000000000002,"end":211.02,"text":"But it's better than drinkin' alone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":225.75,"end":229.92000000000002,"text":"Sing us the song, you're the piano man","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":229.92000000000002,"end":233.56,"text":"Sing us a song tonight","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":233.56,"end":237.8,"text":"Well, we're all in the mood for a melody","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":237.8,"end":242.93,"text":"And you've got us feelin' alright","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":255.79,"end":259.85,"text":"It's a pretty good crowd for a Saturday","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":259.85,"end":263.79,"text":"And the manager gives me a smile","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":263.79,"end":268.19,"text":"'Cause he knows that it's me they've been comin' to see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":268.19,"end":273.55,"text":"To forget about life for a while","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":273.55,"end":277.74,"text":"And the piano, it sounds like a carnival","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":277.74,"end":281.44,"text":"And the microphone smells like a beer","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":281.44,"end":285.84000000000003,"text":"And they sit at the bar and put bread in my jar","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":285.84000000000003,"end":289.74,"text":"And say man what are you doin' here?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":289.74,"end":294.78,"text":"Oh, la, la-la, di-di-da","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":294.78,"end":301.34,"text":"La-la di-di-da da-dum","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":301.34,"end":306.01,"text":"Sing us the song, you're the piano man","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":306.01,"end":309.27,"text":"Sing us a song tonight","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":309.27,"end":313.62,"text":"Well, we're all in the mood for a melody","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":313.62,"end":316.95,"text":"And you've got us feelin' alright","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}